  "description": "Proposed change of use of existing dwelling into 1 x 2--Bed Flat, 1 x 1-Bed Flat and 1 x Studio Flat including changes to rear fenestration and new fences",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The conversion of the larger dwelling into 3 no. smaller dwellings would result in the loss of a residential unit that is suitable and appropriately sized for a family. The proposal would therefore unacceptably undermine the supply of family housing within the Borough for which there is an identified need, contrary to Policies DMH 1 and DMH 2 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part Two Development Management Policies (2020), Policy H10 of the London Plan (2021) and the National Planning Policy Framework (2024).",
    "The proposal, by way of subdivision of the existing dwelling into three self-contained units across two storeys, would lead to an over-intensification of the site, causing harm to the amenities of the neighbouring occupiers, contrary to Policy DMH 4 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part 2.",
    "The proposed units fail to meet the minimum internal space standards set out in the Nationally Described Space Standard (NDSS). As a result, the development would provide substandard accommodation to the detriment of the residential amenity of future occupiers, contrary to Policies DMH 1 and DMH 16 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part 2, as well as Policy D6 of the London Plan 2021."
  ],
